// arcfox: keep these techpack/driver modules OUT of the default soong
// namespace. Several of them export header modules that also exist in
// hardware/qcom-caf/common (qti_audio_kernel_uapi, qti_display_kernel_headers,
// qti_ipa_kernel_headers, smmu_proxy_uapi_header); without this, soong
// bootstrap fails with "module ... already defined".
// Mirrors LineageOS/android_kernel_xiaomi_sm8635-modules' own root Android.bp.
// NOTE: no imports -- Motorola's kernel-msm repo declares no namespace of
// its own (LineageOS added one to their xiaomi kernel fork). A bare
// namespace is all that is needed to avoid the default-namespace clash.
soong_namespace {
}
